linux-hardener (1.3.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix: runtime sysctl writes failed on every local apply (procfs cannot
    host atomic temp-file renames; kernel-interface paths write directly).
  * Fix: firewall backend selection prefers the active backend; ufw rule
    mapping corrected (stateful skip, default deny incoming).
  * Fix: audit rule re-apply is idempotent (flush and retry on duplicate);
    immutable audit config reports a reboot-required skip.
  * Fix: partial-failure applies surface per-plugin errors (desktop + CLI).
  * Fix: desktop findings-tab dropdown styling and skip-count display.

